{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "277ce576-e9c2-42e2-98a0-bec90714df7d",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3171",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah! Veris! Haha, we meet again!",
                "zh": "啊！何以真！哈哈，又见面了啊！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 208.8000030517578,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "669f1ab7-758a-4206-9b37-5208a0124d7a",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3172",
            "content": {
                "en": "Page? Right, Jinlan Temple is just ahead. Are you working here?",
                "zh": "周书？对了，前面是金兰观来着。你是在工作吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 540.0,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9bbc75ca-5f87-4b70-be22-342d75003157",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3173",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yep! I’m in charge of holding people here and only letting everyone in once the awards officially begin.",
                "zh": "对啊！我负责在这里拦着人，等到颁奖正式开始的时候再放大家进去。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 858.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "10f31da8-c889-4609-86ad-ea0299e96eb9",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3174",
            "content": {
                "en": "That sounds tough. Actually, I wanted to head up front to find my friend—her name is Noema, and she’s one of the performers.",
                "zh": "真是辛苦了。其实我想要去前面找一下我朋友，她叫沈梦之，是这次表演的人员之一。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1176.7999267578125,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "377b9f0a-91f5-42f9-8bdf-1381452815e4",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3175",
            "content": {
                "en": "I see... well, I’ll secretly let you through, hehe~ All the performers are waiting up front for the awards anyway. Letting just you in won’t get me scolded by Master.",
                "zh": "这样啊......那我偷偷放你过去吧嘿嘿嘿~反正表演人员都在前面等颁奖，只放你一个进去师父肯定也不会骂我的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1495.199951171875,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "eb737b75-92f2-42bc-9532-d0cf374bdde8",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3176",
            "content": {
                "en": "Thanks. If you’re free this afternoon, want to go look around together?",
                "zh": "谢了，下午有空了要不要一起去逛逛？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1813.5999755859375,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "23b28f91-a1c3-4a5a-93ca-ccadd51340f2",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3177",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sure! My shift ends around noon anyway! I’m telling you, there’s so much good food around Yuntai!",
                "zh": "好啊！我的工作正好到中午就结束了！我跟你说啊，芸台这边可多好吃的了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2132.0,
            "positionY": 230.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3d63d2f1-756d-4475-8fa6-7fea4ceb8f04",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3178",
            "content": {
                "en": "Then it’s a deal. I’ll head ahead first—see you later, Page.",
                "zh": "那就说定了。我先去前面了，晚点再见，周书。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2458.39990234375,
            "positionY": 231.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6b4bfb2c-0898-4f6b-a26f-871628f7d003",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3179",
            "content": {
                "en": "Mm! I’ll be heading over for the awards too. See you in a bit!",
                "zh": "嗯！待会儿颁奖我也会过去的，一会儿见啦！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2776.0,
            "positionY": 231.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        }
